    "body": "Screenshots with privacy by default, please - you will need to provide that in the EU because of the GDPR anyway.\r\n\r\nHow to fix it\r\n* Screenshots without a network connection.\r\n* Screenshot editing without a network connection.\r\n* Save the screenshot locally by default.\r\n* Suggest online saving services - opt-in.\r\n* Remove all cached information about the screenshot after saving.\r\n",
